{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"dongyuan-e-o012f","title":"董卓发掘陵墓取宝物","accounts":[{"id":"dongyuan-e-o012f-account","label":"《董二袁刘传第六》正文","text":"董卓军发掘陵墓，取其宝物。","evidence":["dongyuan-e-o012f-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0053","role":"掘墓取宝","evidence":["dongyuan-e-o012f-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":190,"label":"初平元年迁都时","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"dongyuan-y190","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"dongyuan-q-o012","basis":"初平元年迁都时"},"evidence":["dongyuan-e-o012f-q","dongyuan-q-o012","wudi-q-o009","wudi-q-b-4a17eb75600ced2abdde"]},"ordering_evidence":"dongyuan-e-o012f-q","source_order":[6,75,"O012f"],"order":1515}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0053","name":"董卓","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"dongyuan-e-o012f-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-0f736030533d29f22535","layer":"original","quote":"悉发掘陵墓，取宝物。","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":74,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":22,"end":32,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-o012","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-0f736030533d29f22535","layer":"original","quote":"初平元年二月，乃徙天子都长安。焚烧洛阳宫室，悉发掘陵墓，取宝物。﹝一﹞卓至西京，为太师，号曰“尚父”〖4〗；乘青盖金华（车爪）〔爪车〖5〗〕，画两8〖6〗，时人号曰“竿摩车”。﹝二﹞卓弟曼为左将军，封鄠侯；兄子璜为侍中、中军校尉，典兵〖7〗；宗族内外，并列朝廷。﹝三﹞公卿见卓，谒拜车下，卓不为礼；召呼三台尚书以下，自诣卓府启事〖8〗。﹝四﹞筑郿坞〖9〗，高与长安城埒〖10〗，积谷为三十年储。﹝五﹞云：“事成，雄据天下；不成，守此足以毕老〖11〗。”尝至郿行坞〖12〗，公卿以下，祖道于横门外〖13〗。﹝六﹞卓预施帐幔饮，诱降北地反者数百人〖14〗：于坐中先断其舌，或斩手足，或凿眼，或镬煮之〖15〗；未死，偃转杯案间〖16〗。会者皆战栗，亡失匕箸〖17〗，而卓饮食自若。","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":74,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":337,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-4a17eb75600ced2abdde","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-4a17eb75600ced2abdde","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗初平元年：公元 190 年。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":86,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-93d66253e23c705b336d","start":0,"end":17,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o009","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-20c7e941eb42ee97df8c","layer":"original","quote":"初平元年春正月〖1〗，后将军袁术、冀州牧韩馥、﹝一﹞豫州刺史孔伷、﹝二﹞兖州刺史刘岱、﹝三﹞河内太守王匡、﹝四﹞勃海太守袁绍、陈留太守张邈、东郡太守桥瑁、﹝五﹞山阳太守袁遗、﹝六﹞济北相鲍信，﹝七﹞同时俱起兵〖2〗。众各数万，推绍为盟主。太祖行奋武将军〖3〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":84,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":130,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
